      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay. Any trouble with your breathing at all when you're running about the pitch?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:12",
      "end_timestamp": "02:19",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No. It's fine.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:22",
      "end_timestamp": "02:24",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Grand. Now, I can see in the notes that you had your tonsils out. When was that, do you remember?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:25",
      "end_timestamp": "02:36",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.surgical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "When I was seven.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:37",
      "end_timestamp": "02:39",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.surgical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "The best part of any operation, so it is. Now, do you have any allergies, Cormac, to medicines or anything else?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:53",
      "end_timestamp": "03:04",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:09",
      "end_timestamp": "03:10",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "None at all, good. And who's at home with you these days?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:12",
      "end_timestamp": "03:18",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Mam and my little brother.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:19",
      "end_timestamp": "03:22",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's a busy house, I'd say. And what do you get up to outside of school?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:23",
      "end_timestamp": "03:31",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Hurling. Three nights a week.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:37",
      "end_timestamp": "03:41",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "You're 172 centimetres tall, and you're 61 kilograms.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:22",
      "end_timestamp": "04:26",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Blood pressure is 112 over 68. Your heart rate is 64 beats per minute, and the oxygen in your blood is 99 percent.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:05",
      "end_timestamp": "05:19",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[2]",
        "vital_signs[3]",
        "vital_signs[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Now, because this is a sports medical and you're growing quickly, I'd like to do a few tests. First, I'd like to get a blood test for your iron levels, since lads your age training hard can run a bit low.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:23",
      "end_timestamp": "05:42",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Then you can wait outside for that part, Mrs Fitzgerald. Next, let's get a urine sample from you before you leave today. It's a simple check that the kidneys are fine for sport.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:15",
      "end_timestamp": "06:31",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[1]",
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And last one. I'd like to book you in for a spirometry test, that's the breathing test where you blow into a tube as hard as you can, so we know how your lungs are with the asthma.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:37",
      "end_timestamp": "07:00",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[2]",
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "The surgery will phone you in about a week. For the meantime, keep the blue inhaler in your kit bag at every training session and drink plenty of water, Cormac.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:23",
      "end_timestamp": "07:37",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And I'd like to see you again in six months, just to check you're growing along nicely and the season's treating you well.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:42",
      "end_timestamp": "07:53",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[4]",
        "follow_up[0]"
      ]
